+``gpt-6-astra`` rejects ``none`` and ``minimal`` on both endpoints; the OpenAI
+migration guide says to start at ``low`` if you were using either. ``max`` is
+accepted only on the Responses API — which is also the only endpoint that
+serves function calls for this model, so a tool-calling gptme session can use
+it. gptme routes tool-calling requests for this model to the Responses API even
+if ``GPTME_OPENAI_RESPONSES_API`` is disabled, because Chat Completions has no
